{
  "normal": [
    {
      "text": "* Hey, punk!\n* What's up!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne0",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* A-ACHOO!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Papyrus, how can you\n  stand this cold?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne2",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "I HAVE NO SKIN.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* So why don't we\n  stand in Grillby's\n  instead?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne9",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "BECAUSE I HATE\nGREASE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* But you don't have\n  a stomach!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne2",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "NO, BUT I HAVE\nSTANDARDS!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "repeat": [
    {
      "text": "* Papyrus...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne0",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Why do you live\n  in an icy wasteland?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "THE RENT'S CHEAP.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Really?\n* Don't you live in\n  a huge house?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne9",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "YEAH, BUT MY\nBROTHER PAYS\nFOR IT.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Where's your brother\n  get the money to\n  pay for it...?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne2",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "OH, THAT'S SIMPLE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IT'S A MYSTERY.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "letter9": [
    {
      "text": "* So? What are you\n  waiting for?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* The sooner you get\n  it over with, the\n  better!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "exFull": [
    {
      "text": "* Hey, you sure\n  are carrying a\n  lot of things.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* If someone needed\n  to give you a thing,\n  they sure couldn't!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "ex": [
    {
      "text": "* What?\n* You LOST the letter!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* What the HECK!?\n* How!? Why!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Ughhh...\n* This is unbelievable.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne7",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I should be really\n  disappointed in you.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne7",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* But, uh, to tell\n  you the truth, I'm\n  kind of relieved!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne9",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* While you were gone,\n  I actually wrote\n  a WAY BETTER letter!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* And this time, you\n  WON'T lose it!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne6",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I guarantee it!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne2",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": " \\F0",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne2",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* (You got the Undyne Letter\n  EX.)",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne2",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "letterFull": [
    {
      "text": "* Hey, I have something\n  to give you...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne9",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* But you're carrying\n  way too much!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne2",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "letter": [
    {
      "text": "* Um, so, I have a\n  favor to ask you.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne9",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Uuuuh, I...\n* I need you to deliver\n  this letter.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne0",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* To Dr. Alphys.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne9",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Huh!?\n* Why don't I do it\n  myself...?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* ... um.\n* W-well...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne8",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I-it's kind of\n  personal, but we're\n  friends... so...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne9",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I'll t-tell you...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne8",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Hotland SUUUUCKS!!!\n* I don't wanna have\n  to go over there!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne6",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* So here you go.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne3",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": " \\F0",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne3",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* (You got the Undyne's Letter.)",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne3",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Oh, and if you\n  read it...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne9",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I'll KILL you.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne2",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Thanks so much!\n* You're the best!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne9",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "mailbox": [
    {
      "text": "* Oh my god!\n* The letter's not\n  to PAPYRUS!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "YEAH, UNDYNE'S\nGOT A POINT!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WHY DIDN'T SHE\nWRITE A LETTER\nTO ME INSTEAD?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Fine, you want a\n  letter!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I'll give you a\n  letter!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* YOU GET AN \"F\"!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne6",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "OH NO!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrussweat",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WHAT'S THE F\nFOR?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Friendship!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne9",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "shed": [
    {
      "text": "HELLO.\nTHAT'S NOT\nMY HOUSE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT'S JUST MY\nCOOL TOOLSHED.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Do you call it\n  your COOLSHED!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne6",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "NO!!!\nI'VE NEVER THOUGHT\nOF THAT!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT'S WHY WE'RE\nFRIENDS,\nUNDYNE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU ENRICH MY\nLIFE WITH SHED-\nBASED PUNS.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* That's the only\n  one I've ever\n  made, dude.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne9",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "shedAgain": [
    {
      "text": "YOU SHOULD LEARN\nA PRIVACY.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "shedPunishment": [
    {
      "text": "READY FOR ANOTHER\nNIGHT IN THE\nPUNISHMENT SHACK?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Oh my GOD, I don't\n  even wanna KNOW.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "DON'T BE SO\nJUDGMENTAL,\nUNDYNE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "MY SHACK IS A\nFOUR STAR\nESTABLISHMENT.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* What, lemme guess.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne0",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Sometimes you cut a\n  hot dog into the\n  dog food, right?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne6",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "WHAT!?!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "HOW'D YOU KNOW?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* OH MY GOD! NO!\n* I WAS JOKING!!!\n* DON'T DO THIS!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_undyne1",
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
